    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. Heard learned Counsel for the Applicant and learned APP for the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 863,
      "end": 936,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "I have perused the records and considered the submissions advanced by the learned Counsel for the respective parties .",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 937,
      "end": 1055,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. The aforesaid crime was registered pursuant to the FIR lodged by Vishal Gaikwad .",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1141,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vishal Gaikwad",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1125,
          "end": 1139
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20279529690742493
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "A perusal of the FIR reveals that the Applicant Nitin Bodhare had assured the first informant that he knew several officers in Navy and that he could secure him job in Navy on payment of pps 1 of 2 14 aba 774-.doc Rs.8,00,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1142,
      "end": 1370,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Nitin Bodhare",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1190,
          "end": 1203
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20636902749538422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The first informant paid him an amount of Rs.50,000/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1371,
      "end": 1425,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2809019386768341
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The Applicant did not secure the job nor did he refund the money.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1426,
      "end": 1491,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28373298048973083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Hence the FIR came to be lodged against both the Applicants.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1492,
      "end": 1552,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26942458748817444
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "Nitin Maruti Bodhare And Anr vs The State Of Maharashtra on 23 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/172633991/\n1 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1553,
      "end": 1688,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Nitin Maruti Bodhare And Anr vs The State Of Maharashtra",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1554,
          "end": 1610
        },
        {
          "text": "23 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1614,
          "end": 1642
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The material on record prima facie reveals that the Applicant has not only cheated the first informant, but has also cheated two other victims.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1689,
      "end": 1832,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20983466506004333
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The FIR also reveals that the Applicant had taken money from the said victims under the pretext that he knew several officers in the Navy and that he can secure jobs for them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1833,
      "end": 2008,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19718271493911743
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The records reveal that the money paid by these victims has been credited in the account of the Applicant No.2 Mrs. Pournima Nitin Bodhare.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2009,
      "end": 2148,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pournima Nitin Bodhare",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2125,
          "end": 2147
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15883079171180725
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The investigation is still in progress and the Investigating Agency needs to ascertain whether apart from these three victims,\nsome other persons are also cheated by the Applicants under the same pretext and this can be done only through custodial interrogation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2149,
      "end": 2411,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2862914204597473
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "5. Considering the nature of the accusation against the Applicants, in my considered view this is not a case for exercising discretion under Section 438 oif Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2413,
      "end": 2577,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2554,
          "end": 2565
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2570,
          "end": 2577
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25902581214904785
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Hence the application is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2578,
      "end": 2613,
      "entities": [],
